# The built console. In a SOURCE checkout the control plane serves
# ../volt-web/dist directly (see resolveWebDist in src/config.ts); this path
# only exists inside the Docker image, where the Dockerfile copies it in.
# A checked-in or hand-copied copy here goes stale silently and serves an old
# version of the app with no error anywhere.
